The reward function:
- +130 for reaching the far right end of the terrain (goal)
- -100 for falling (hull touches the ground)
- Forward progress reward proportional to velocity at each step
- -0.00035 * motor_torque^2 control cost per step
A good episode scores around 200-300; scores below 0 indicate the robot fell or barely moved.
